  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of all natural numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> such that <math><mn>100</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>200</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>91</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is",
